## CONSTANTS (must stay in sync: backend ↔ frontend)

### UNIT_CONVERSIONS (→ grams)
  g: 1.0 | ml: 1.0 (water density) | oz: 28.3495 | lb: 453.592 | kg: 1000.0

### FDA_DAILY_VALUES (2020 reference)
  fat_total_g: 78 | fat_saturated_g: 20 | cholesterol_mg: 300 | sodium_mg: 2300
  carbohydrates_total_g: 275 | fiber_g: 28 | vitamin_d_mcg: 20 | calcium_mg: 1300
  iron_mg: 18 | potassium_mg: 4700
  (calories, sugar_g, protein_g have NO %DV)

### NUTRIENT_FIELDS (FDA label order, 13 total)
  calories, fat_total_g, fat_saturated_g, cholesterol_mg, sodium_mg,
  carbohydrates_total_g, fiber_g, sugar_g, protein_g,
  vitamin_d_mcg, calcium_mg, iron_mg, potassium_mg

### Validation limits (models.py)
  MAX_NAME_LENGTH: 120 | MAX_INGREDIENT_AMOUNT: 1_000_000
  MIN_INGREDIENTS: 1 | MAX_INGREDIENTS: 100
  MIN_PORTION_DIVISOR: 1 | MAX_PORTION_DIVISOR: 999
  MIN_WIDTH: 0.1in | MAX_WIDTH: 12in | MAX_HEIGHT: 20in

### Label defaults
  widthInches: 2.75 | heightInches: null (auto) | portionDivisor: 8

### localStorage keys
  nl_preferences (recents+favorites) | nl_saved_recipes (v2, recipes catalog) | nl-theme

### savedRecipesStore limits
  MAX_RECIPES: 50 | MAX_VERSIONS_PER: 20

